Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "RoadObstructionByFallenTree" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :tree1 ;
    :hasActor :policeVehicle ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :foggy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:tree1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Fallen tree trunk obstructing the entire roadway" .

:policeVehicle a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Police vehicle visible behind the tree obstruction" .

:foggy1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "High probability of collision with immovable tree trunk on road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Collision risk due to a large fallen tree trunk completely blocking the lane of travel in low-visibility foggy conditions.
Severity Score: 0.95